{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3f7b4e891db50619e2f4166d27a204111e259d375403600590cdd40a2e4c3f9a", "ja": "（今日はこれから、次の定期公演の打ち合わせだ。\nみんなは集まってるかな？）", "zh": "（今天接下来要开下次定期公演的碰头会。大家都到齐了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "18a1c2fb70cdec20831ec9dff6901bb71e073f5443c4bb3023d1ccd204bce616", "ja": "やよいちゃん……新メンバーの、中学生……\n他に、どんな子がいるの……？", "zh": "弥生……新成员里的初中生……还有哪些人……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "7c30edd8c662ed3b6025e6dfd05999f95089a1f524399ed02046a5fbd05d81e4", "ja": "えっと……雑誌のモデルの人と、将棋のプロの人とか。\nあと、インフル……インフルなんとかさん！", "zh": "那个……有杂志模特，还有职业将棋棋手。\n另外，还有个叫“网红……网红什么来着”的人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "399cf14589756ec38e388b6f2751bb7deef90267d90b19a1155968b21009ff55", "ja": "……インフルエンサーのことかにゃ？", "zh": "……你说的是网红吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "eb7752daa0b31707efbe11b652d36aebfe9ec24080e441866cb546a202bc41cd", "ja": "そんな感じの名前だったかも！　あとは、\nプロのゲーマーさんもいたよ。杏奈ちゃん、知ってる？", "zh": "名字好像就是这种感觉！还有一位职业电竞选手。杏奈，你知道她吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "9f6de4fb8a9c0a8079efc2c8ebf4125379cdcf8d1c0caa962f6a1e2d1c205b06", "ja": "うん……。中学生、プロゲーマー……\nいろんな大会、出てるから……海外でも、有名……。", "zh": "嗯……那名初中生职业玩家……\n参加过各种大赛……在海外，也很有名……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "295e88c5ba9f88b2725125551caca6c8a4ed249895084450ccbca6d370f8828c", "ja": "ふむ……さすが、人気番組だね！　これはいずれ、\n茜ちゃんにも出演オファーがあったりするかも……？", "zh": "嗯……不愧是热门节目！说不定以后还会向小茜发出演邀约呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "4b914e190579acafef901e6fe03f33f76857b61115d9d3fe5434249646e4deb7", "ja": "そしたら、いっしょに出られますね！\n……あれ？　でも茜さんって高校生じゃ……？", "zh": "那样的话，我们就能一起出演了！\n……咦？可是茜小姐不是高中生吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1008_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "915fe566cbb28f21cbfafb47500b90d5e4d7817c80fc65d39e8d0077bcccb3e4", "ja": "お疲れさま～！\nともか、おやぶん！　もうみんな来てるぞ！", "zh": "辛苦啦～！\n环，老大！大家已经都到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "933536656f2cc1f148b438d1553cb6a10238be6749e762a96ef43e0301d915d5", "ja": "あら、本当ですね～。\nみなさん、お疲れさまです～。", "zh": "哎呀，真的呢～。\n大家辛苦了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1011_p", "source_sha256": "66737759b0a08991b7e5fe23895f7c15e6770dbbb4d6bf451419a1ead3fd6093", "ja": "お疲れさま！　おっ、みんなもう揃ってるな。", "zh": "辛苦啦！哦，大家已经到齐了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "be63a550df21013aa05409750e69a15c0d6151d01c858a3da0c503573a30a0ba", "ja": "環ちゃん、朋花さん。\n{$P$}も、お疲れさまです！", "zh": "小环、朋花。\n{$P$}先生，也辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "1acf42468339586fcac6413e90c56626daa2dbb0b7bbd74d8b25584257548be2", "ja": "今、『中学生』って聞こえたぞ～！\n中学生が、どうかしたの？", "zh": "刚才我好像听到了“初中生”～！\n初中生怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "e6c0a3354c977c31253bf8e2b8e21bb4ba026570117eb15210e813cc8d313353", "ja": "んと……やよいちゃんが、\n『中学生ダイアリー』に出る、から……その話……。", "zh": "那个……因为弥生，\n要出演《中学生日记》……在聊这件事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "76ee62438c7e46b3554640524d1038122ecfe675d46cb0b4f2f2c94680d0bca4", "ja": "そういえば、やよいちゃんが、\n次のレギュラー出演者に決まったんでしたね～。", "zh": "对了，说起来弥生要成为下一位固定出演者了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "903e52bbd6bc0256e0e54a95668c27a62117e7c736e6d46eaa95cb88772031d3", "ja": "様々なジャンルで活躍する中学生が、テーマに沿って\n自由に話をする……なかなか、興味深い番組ですよ～。", "zh": "初中生们活跃于各个领域，围绕主题畅所欲言……真是个相当有意思的节目呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "25ecf24451725920aa448429ca178351e0ea86afa4bfcf6c7614db8e76ecbfb4", "ja": "へ～！\nたまきも、中学生になったら出られるのかな？", "zh": "哦～！\n环上了初中之后，也能参加吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1018_p", "source_sha256": "d2f4600fa275a70372d261c393484c98fb3aec6ec845aeab5fd12f33ed65601c", "ja": "そうだな、環も中学生になったら、\nオーディションを受けてみるといいかもしれないな。", "zh": "是啊，环升上初中后，也许可以试着参加选拔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f204751e71aa2bb7b45f863038cbf2b03b54132d24a38ef1cfbe3722537fc53c", "ja": "やよいは公演と、\nレギュラー番組の収録で忙しくなるけど……。", "zh": "虽然弥生之后会因为公演和常规节目的录制变得忙碌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1020_005yay", "source_sha256": "cfa5cad2f13b8526159fde4767b0d36f674c66dd9d9fb918ba598b99130c913a", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ、{$P$}！\n私、元気モリモリですから！", "zh": "没问题的，{$P$}！\n我现在可是元气满满呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1021_p", "source_sha256": "095ffc765ecfcb2d13e6b6c3c70a771caec7f8e86c77ba85e5355333d6e147bb", "ja": "うん、頼りにしてるぞ！\nそれじゃ早速、次の公演の打ち合わせを始めよう。", "zh": "嗯，就靠你了！\n那我们这就开始商量下次公演的事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1022_p", "source_sha256": "b478099878195a077c9f59b73017606ae3b3366e3aae4325a9f698e2bc83d567", "ja": "今回は、やよいの新曲披露がある。\nデモを持ってきたから、みんなで聴いてみよう。", "zh": "这次有弥生的新歌要披露。\n我把试听曲带来了，大家一起听听吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1024_005yay", "source_sha256": "1729f6a5a7c17aa7673256b4f3b9de8d26b7eb41cc5dfd3bbc147d96efa25e79", "ja": "はわっ！？　なんだか、とってもかわいい曲ですー！\nえっと、これって、恋の歌……？", "zh": "哇！？这首歌感觉特别可爱！\n那个，这是首恋爱歌曲……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1025_p", "source_sha256": "ead0f88d3e06e9841bb670d4f2321a72ef9d5814f3d6a1ac2d6d5dbeea6ad9fb", "ja": "うん。やよいの元気な面は、前回の公演で\nたくさん見せられたと思うんだ。", "zh": "嗯。我觉得上次公演已经充分展现了やよい活泼有精神的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1026_p", "source_sha256": "70fb597281369f38c6c4c48bb2a70e94078c311a50cd07055a18942d01ee6169", "ja": "だから次は、等身大の中学生らしい、やよいの魅力を\n届けられたらと思ってる！", "zh": "所以这次，我想展现弥生作为普通中学生的魅力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1027_005yay", "source_sha256": "14618798e8f0eba43d7025fdc596f33f3541d8a074192314122bf453415245fa", "ja": "等身大の私……ですか？", "zh": "真实的我……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1028_023aka", "source_sha256": "aec4331f673419a6984a209fbf6bd602644d995625fecca2ca36e1ccef704a73", "ja": "なるほど～……じゃあコンセプトは、\n『今どきの中学生』だね！", "zh": "原来如此～……那概念就是“现在的初中生”啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1029_005yay", "source_sha256": "272b4bf711ebe57e0437ea43a834ab57d823a5a04c23ae2f99f2ceb057dbc765", "ja": "今どき……？", "zh": "现在的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1030_p", "source_sha256": "1066949929b073387eadd0df0605b44f52cc67cd77afc07bf1a64382be58cead", "ja": "そうだな。今どきの中学生らしい、\nやよいの姿が見せられるといいかもしれないな。", "zh": "是啊。要是能展现出符合当今初中生风格的弥生，或许也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1031_031tom", "source_sha256": "4ea07945c2490e6e8a16eab7fd9759d97d2b192bfad4e58a0b092ab13113aeea", "ja": "うふふ。『中学生ダイアリー』のコンセプト、\nそのままですね～。けど、悪くありませんよ～。", "zh": "呵呵。正是《初中生日记》的概念呢～不过，也不坏哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1032_024ann", "source_sha256": "935bde21b817d5d924eac3743ec8a60d0a628beb3a35ef200655c0967f8dae9a", "ja": "けど……今どきの、中学生……？\n……どんなのが、今どき……？", "zh": "不过……现在的初中生……？\n……现在的初中生，是什么样的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1033_p", "source_sha256": "5bffaf97773d65638dd6535e85ba5eb8b8ed78e4d74465001d8da0a255b50c01", "ja": "えっ？　そうだな……アイドルと親和性が\n高いものだと、メイクとか……。", "zh": "诶？这个嘛……要说和偶像亲和度高的东西，化妆之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1034_005yay", "source_sha256": "cb25142a6d46c89c4f00c9852b3319c963aa29bc7e6d3433ad12b742b2866fa2", "ja": "私、お仕事以外でメイクしたことないかも……。\nいつも、メイクさんにおまかせだし。", "zh": "我好像从来没在工作以外化过妆……\n平时都是交给化妆师来弄的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1035_p", "source_sha256": "de2adc4ecf15e6b0ef09b96c67e2fbbb1e696e4dce0cd05a3c106866e1a52f9d", "ja": "そ、そうだよな。後は……\n中学生の間で、流行しているものとか……。", "zh": "是、是啊。还有……\n比如初中生之间流行的东西……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1036_031tom", "source_sha256": "413ae042935a36a0923fa5394f3f0e11e179b9f3ace2f142d362ddda6fd6579f", "ja": "そうですね～。最近、あるブランドのバッグが\n人気で、それで通学するのが流行りましたけど……。", "zh": "是啊～最近有个品牌的包很受欢迎，背着它上学成了一股潮流，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1037_005yay", "source_sha256": "ea68aff6cd4a204cd7a805d4a05677f72e14b150c398da4243657bd8ade21ba2", "ja": "ブランドのバッグ……？\nでも私、べろちょろがあるし……。", "zh": "名牌包包……？\n可是我已经有贝罗乔罗了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_096_1038_040tam", "source_sha256": "53b77f4d06a8927537c7fb16fd9b19bfe4fde2c11c7ea8c4a260012bd008c91e", "ja": "めぐみが、中学生になると原宿で遊ぶって言ってたぞ！\nやよいちゃんは、原宿で遊んだことある？", "zh": "惠美说过，上了初中就会去原宿玩呢！\n弥生，你去原宿玩过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
